  unitName: "Cheery Bj\xF8rn & Linlin"
  unitId: 830538
  unitNumber: 8372
  description: "In the absence of any clues to her former companion's trail, Bj\xF8rn
    & Linlin decided to strike out on their own. They spent many days on the road,
    staying off the beaten track for fear that their odd appearance would draw too
    much attention. After many delays (and more than a few misadventures thanks to
    Linlin's literal-mindedness), they finally managed to find clues to his whereabouts
    thanks to a young man who seemed rather eager to help them. Too eager, Bj\xF8rn
    grumbled, but Linlin soothed things over with a few pats and back rubs. It took
    quite a fair bit of searching, but at last they found the swordsman in a faraway
    city - and trouble quite closely behind him. They managed to beat back their
    pursuers with steel, heavy punches, a little magic and a special song before
    escaping. Quite the relief, Bj\xF8rn rumbled to himself. As Linlin joyfully reunited
    with her companion, Bj\xF8rn looked for the young man to give him his thanks,
    but it seemed that he had disappeared. While they began to travel together, a
    pit stop to be clean and hibernate was certainly in order..."
  summonDesc: "Come on, Bj\xF8rn! You already had five minutes! Ehhhh?! Five more?
    Give me a break, you big guy!"
  fusionDesc: "Yay, we're all done! We're so awesome, Bj\xF8rn! Now fo-what do you
    mean, you still have presents?!"
  evoDesc: "Hey, Bj\xF8rn! You look grea-wait, let me fiddle with that hat...and 
    your fur...and that box.."
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
